    "body": "Cython's compiler cache currently returns before the normal pipeline writes a requested depfile. With `--cache --depfile`, a clean build can restore generated sources without their dependency files, causing Ninja to miss subsequent changes to imported `.pxd` files. This PR modifies the cache pipeline to generate depfiles as well using the same helper as successful compilations. To verify that this works, it adds a regression test that deletes the generated C++ and depfile, then checks that both are recreated with the imported dependency recorded.\n\nImplemented with assistance from OpenAI Codex.\n",
    "closed_at": null,
